# Per-Rails lockfiles are resolved per job, not committed. The matrix runs
# Ruby 3.2-3.4 against each gemfile, and one lockfile cannot satisfy three
# Rubies: resolving on 3.4 picked parallel 2.1.0, which requires >= 3.3, and
# every Ruby 3.2 job failed at bundle install.
gemfiles/*.gemfile.lock
